{"id":"661301","name":"蘑菇豆腐猪肉汤","author":"美食家2202k_MfwP","authorId":"13083755","desc":"","cover":"images/661301/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"平菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"熟猪肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"10厘米"},{"name":"豆芽","amount":"少量"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"2--5颗"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/661301/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅热油，加入大葱、熟猪肉。翻炒。","img":"images/661301/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入少量生抽，豆芽、辣椒翻炒。","img":"images/661301/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入凉水盖盖子煮。","img":"images/661301/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取少量淀粉，如果，想要汤浓一点，可以再适量增加1至2勺。","img":"images/661301/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"淀粉用凉水搅拌成液态，不要有疙瘩。搅入锅中。","img":"images/661301/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐、味精、胡椒粉。","img":"images/661301/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"水烧开后煮1-3分钟。","img":"images/661301/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入青菜，盖盖子烫熟后关火。","img":"images/661301/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"可以加入一些香油调味。","img":"images/661301/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}